      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Very often players use nicknames that is difficult to read, pronounce and understand. So if I add such player to my friend-list, it’ll be good to have possibility to add an understandable alias to his name or replace his nickname. Also players constantly changes they avatars and Steam-players changes his nicks, so if you have many friends you can forget some of them under this circumstances. So we also need a possibility to add a short description to each player in the friend-list. Something like a dossier. We can access this dossier in the detailed section of friend-list and freshen in our mind information about this player.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
