      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Don't think it's good idea to overload nameplate. In new safety it's already tons icons on nameplate that not always easy to read. But I think it's good Idea to put that badges into user profile like I described here: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/alternative-way-to-note-and-award-creators-instead-of-trustsafety\nCustom local per-user marks/icons can be implemented here too instead of / as addition for fav friends.\n\nI am for this, but not in nameplate.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
