      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name}: Your suggestion is also good. Let’s view such case: for example, I have friends with nicknames \" غسان عبدالرحمن بن الخطاب \" and \" 初音ミク \"  :) . I would set an aliases in friend-list for players having such difficult names for me, for example \"Ghassan\" and \"Miku\". In this case instead of nicknames \" غسان عبدالرحمن بن الخطاب \", \" 初音ミク \" above the heads of my friends I would see the names “Ghassan” and \"Miku\". This replacement of the nicknames will be local and actual only for me. What do you think about such possibility?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
