  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "ability to customize nametag or add small icons to a player's nametag for milestones completed by the player\n\nexample:\nPlayer's world is on the featured/community spotlight, you get a name plate customization like an icon and/or a glow to you name tag\nPlayer's public avatar is most favorited/saved\nPlayer is seen as a good barbuddy, roleplayer, ect ect",
